OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost a tonne of cocaine found in
OL,4,Aorange crates
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight people have been arrested after
OL,7,Falmost a tonne of cocaine was found
OL,8,Fhidden in boxes of oranges in what the
OL,9,FMet Police said was the force's biggest
OL,10,Fseizure of its kind.
OL,12,FThe class A drug was found wrapped in
OL,13,Fplastic packaging in orange crates at
OL,14,FNew Spitalfields Market, east London. A
OL,15,Fman was arrested nearby carrying a
OL,16,Ffurther 100kg (220lb) of cocaine, while
OL,17,Fanother 250kg (551lb) was found in a
OL,18,Florry stopped near Maidstone, Kent.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
