OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost a tonne of cocaine found in
OL,4,Aorange crates
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers seized a total of 893kg
OL,7,F(1,969lb) of cocaine and #450,000 in
OL,8,Fcash in the operation, which targeted
OL,9,Forganised crime groups suspected of
OL,10,Fimporting class A drugs into the UK.
OL,12,FDet Supt Lindsey Billany said the drugs
OL,13,Fwould have been worth "millions of
OL,14,Fpounds".
